---
import InformationPage from "../components/InformationPage.astro";
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
import "../styles/information.css";
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Privacy | FundraisingDirectory.net"
  description="Current privacy information for the minimum FundraisingDirectory.net launch site."
>
  <InformationPage
    eyebrow="Privacy"
    breadcrumbLabel="Privacy"
    title="Privacy information for the current site."
    intro="This page describes the site's current data-handling behavior as of October 15, 2026."
  >
    <section>
      <h2>Current site features</h2>
      <p>
        The current site does not include user accounts, a contact form, payment
        processing, or advertising technology. The Fundraiser Finder processes
        your choices in your browser; it does not create an account or save a
        user profile.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Optional audience measurement</h2>
      <p>
        The site includes a consent-gated Google Analytics 4 integration that is
        inactive unless a valid site measurement identifier is configured and
        analytics consent has been granted. When inactive, the site does not
        request the Google Analytics script. If enabled with consent, the site may
        measure page use and general interactions such as provider searches,
        directory filters, Finder completion, and outbound provider-link clicks.
      </p>
      <p>
        Analytics events do not include the words entered into provider search,
        Finder answers, form text, or provider ranking and commercial-affiliation
        data. Google and hosting infrastructure may still process technical data
        such as IP address, browser information, page URL, and request time under
        their respective terms. Where consent is required, analytics should remain
        disabled unless and until that consent is provided; withdrawing consent
        disables further analytics events from this site.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Technical request data</h2>
      <p>
        As with most websites, hosting and security infrastructure may process
        technical request information needed to deliver and protect the site,
        such as an IP address, browser details, requested URL, and request time.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Links to provider websites</h2>
      <p>
        Provider pages link to independent third-party websites. Their privacy
        practices and transactions are governed by their own policies, not this
        page. Review a provider's terms before submitting information or making a
        payment.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Future changes</h2>
      <p>
        If contact forms, advertising, accounts, additional analytics uses, or
        other data-handling features are added, this notice should be updated
        before those features are enabled.
      </p>
    </section>
  </InformationPage>
</SiteLayout>
